Graded view page: Sort control on every word, PC Illustrator from TCGplayer

Each row in the Rarity / Finish / Special / Series / Era / Unidentified lists gets a Sort control: the word (an
unidentified phrase's unknown words, editable), where it goes (or Meaningless / Unsorted), the word it means the
same as, where it may match and a note; sent to the collector and echoed on the page until the next site build files
it. Unidentified rows show their unknown words. The PC Illustrator column and Review show TCGplayer's artist.

